.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-scan 1  "xil-scan " 
.SH NAME
xil\-scan \- Pre\-flight scanner: check a production script for unknown speakers/sections.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-scan\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-speakers\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-sfx\fR] [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-harvest\-cast\fR] [\fB\-\-backfill\-cast\fR] [\fB\-\-scripts\-dir\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pre\-flight scanner: check a production script for unknown speakers/sections.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output machine\-readable JSON instead of the human report
.TP
\fB\-\-speakers\fR \fI<SPEAKERS>\fR
Path to speakers.json (default: auto\-detect from CWD, then built\-in)
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Show name override — selects configs/{slug}/speakers.json (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Path to sfx_<TAG>.json — enables direction\-text audit against existing config
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S04E04) — auto\-discovers sfx config when \-\-sfx is omitted
.TP
\fB\-\-harvest\-cast\fR
Scan all scripts in scripts/ for CAST: blocks and report speakers missing from speakers.json
.TP
\fB\-\-backfill\-cast\fR
Add CAST: blocks to scripts that don\*(Aqt have one, inferring speakers from parsed JSON or body scan
.TP
\fB\-\-scripts\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Scripts directory for \-\-harvest\-cast / \-\-backfill\-cast (default: scripts/ under workspace root)
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Apply changes without confirmation (for \-\-harvest\-cast and \-\-backfill\-cast)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview backfill changes without writing files (implied when \-\-yes is absent for \-\-backfill\-cast)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR]
Path to the markdown production script (required unless \-\-harvest\-cast or \-\-backfill\-cast)
